{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S04、S13把想留住当下、害怕未来失去以及因此想收回喜欢的心理动机更多交给感受词暗示，因果解释不如X直白完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的话句更短，重点词放大加亮，普通观众可以先抓住每段发生了什么；感受字缩小并按音乐进程出现，也让情绪变化与音乐细节更容易对应。尤其是反复出现的水波、小船、摇荡、靠岸等意象，让十四段形成了连续的体验，结尾也能回扣开头。X的优势是心理因果交代得更完整，但右侧短词较多地同时堆叠，音乐与感受的对应也不如Y细致。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8805c916-83e7-4cff-91eb-dc0ff94c3457", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T231849070738Z", "elapsed_seconds": 62.735, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T23:19:51.828828+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a3d4f2c3748478987281a8173399314fdc00f7e3305a73e8d8f4bdd97b32f597", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py"